  data: {
    LLM: "Count your high cards (Aces, Tens, Kings). These are your point winners. Try to capture opponents' high cards while protecting your own.\n\nTrump management is key. With many trumps, lead them to draw out opponents' trumps. With few trumps, save them for crucial tricks. Watch which trumps have been played.\n\nSignal to your partner through your card play. Leading certain cards can indicate strength or weakness in suits. In partnership games, cooperation is essential - don't undermine your partner's winning cards.",
